WEBVTT

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.230
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.354 --> 00:00:11.611
<v><b>F1:</b></v> Stupidly, I forgot to take some earplugs.

00:00:13.924 --> 00:00:14.645
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.645 --> 00:00:18.011
<v><b>F2:</b></v> We lived under the same roof for a month.

00:00:20.276 --> 00:00:21.051
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.101 --> 00:00:24.653
<v><b>M1:</b></v> One couple had to sleep on the sofa bed.

00:00:26.737 --> 00:00:27.480
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:28.481 --> 00:00:30.602
<v><b>M2:</b></v> Some people don’t mind being on their own.

00:00:32.471 --> 00:00:33.332
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.119
<v><b>F3:</b></v> I put all my bits and pieces into a bag and left.

00:00:40.017 --> 00:00:40.835
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:44.242
<v><b>F4:</b></v> We weren’t talking to each other by the end of the week.

00:00:46.098 --> 00:00:46.925
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:50.634
<v><b>M3:</b></v> We wanted to go on a boat trip, but they didn’t.

00:00:52.513 --> 00:00:53.234
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:54.299 --> 00:00:57.401
<v><b>M4:</b></v> My siblings are by nature incredibly sociable.